# type(scope): what changed, in words a reader of the changelog understands
#
# types:  feat fix docs test chore build ci refactor perf style revert
# scopes: core parsers server mcp cli work work-jira work-azdo work-fixture
#         e2e scripts ci docs proposals examples release deps viewer skills
# `!` after the scope, or a `BREAKING CHANGE:` footer, marks a breaking change.
#
# Body (optional): why, what a reader should know, what was measured.
# Footers: Co-Authored-By: … — never a session link (the repo is public).
